  "definition": "Pesticide",
  "effectiveDate": "1996-05-02",
  "historyNote": "#150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4812, eff 5-3-90; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (from Pes 101.18)",
